# Copy this file to main_table.env, then fill paths and ORIGINAL official commands.
# Do not use the Steer-CD 'collect_letter_logits' scripts: they do not reproduce Table I.
#
# Expected dataset: full VoxParadox benchmark JSON, 10 tasks x 200 = 2000.
# Each command below must:
#  1. run baseline and original IAAN (signed real-minus-noise top K, encoder FFN scaling),
#  2. use LISTEN-dev-selected K/g, not VoxParadox tuning,
#  3. use the *official model greedy-generation prompts* and *data/eval.py* parser,
#  4. write to $IAAN_OUTPUT_DIR/<model>/baseline_report.json and iaan_report.json.
#
# Example:
# IAAN_VOXPARADOX_JSON=/path/to/VoxParadox/data/voxparadox_full.json
# IAAN_AUDIO_BASE=/path/to/VoxParadox/data
#
# The original perq_official.py files and external evaluator are NOT checked
# into this repository. Supply your original working commands below.
# IAAN_AF3_CMD='python /path/to/original_af3_runner.py ...'
# IAAN_QWEN_CMD='python /path/to/original_qwen_runner.py ...'
# IAAN_KIMI_CMD='python /path/to/original_kimi_runner.py ...'
